    "description": "StartFragment\n\n## 🧪 Banking API Test Collection\n\n**Version:** 1.0.0  \n**Environment:** Local Development  \n**Base URLs:**\n\n- Client Service: `http://localhost:8081`\n    \n- Account Service: `http://localhost:8082`\n    \n\n---\n\n### 📋 Collection Overview\n\nComprehensive API test suite for the **Banking Microservices System**, covering all functional requirements (F1-F7) with pre-configured requests, test scripts, and example responses.\n\n---\n\n### 🗂️ Folder Structure\n\nTable\n\n| Folder | Description | Endpoints |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **🏦 Clients** | Person/Customer management | `POST /api/clientes`  <br>`GET /api/clientes`  <br>`PUT /api/cliente/{id}`  <br>`DELETE /api/clientes/{id}` |\n| **💳 Accounts** | Bank account operations | `POST /api/cuentas`  <br>`GET /api/cuentas`  <br>`PATCH /api/cuentas/{id}` |\n| **💰 Movements** | Financial transactions | `POST /api/movimientos`  <br>`GET /api/movimientos` |\n| **📊 Reports** | Account statements | `GET /api/reportes?fechaInicio={date}&fechaFin={date}&clienteId={id}` |\n| **🔧 Admin** | Health checks & diagnostics | `GET /actuator/health`  <br>`GET /actuator/info` |\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 Test Scenarios Covered\n\n#### Functional Requirements\n\n- ✅ **F1**: Complete CRUD operations for all entities\n    \n- ✅ **F2**: Transaction registration with balance updates\n    \n- ✅ **F3**: \"Insufficient Balance\" error validation\n    \n- ✅ **F4**: Account statement reports with date filtering\n    \n- ✅ **F5-F7**: Integration testing support\n    \n\nEndFragment",
